# Conformance probe pack for the order of decode errors across the layer
# (spec 0.34, Decode): an outer field whose transform can fail, then an inner
# message. Most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   byte 0      s1, one ascii character
#   the rest    one conformance-inner-fixed message
format     conformance-inner-asciihead
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.s1  8  ascii
inner   conformance-inner-fixed
